{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udccf <i>Booster</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open packs. Collect cards. Worship the RNG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Booster</i>, every 3 hours you get a chance to pull something awesome \u2014 or hilariously useless. Each booster contains a randomly selected card \u2014 from common critters to rare kings and legendary sharks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd55 Get boosters every 3 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd01 Card rotation &amp; limited-time sets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf08 Rarity system: Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 Cards are Steam Inventory items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u267b\ufe0f Trade, sell, or keep them forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf89 Super casual, extremely addictive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Just click. Collect. And see what fate gives you.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692260?t=1746223399","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692260?t=1746223399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692260/2a992d1979ca3a08341db7a9ff30c36cef60cc04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746223399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692260/2a992d1979ca3a08341db7a9ff30c36cef60cc04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746223399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udccf <i>Booster</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open packs. Collect cards. Worship the RNG.</strong